comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-18T06:30:42.678Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: searched all-status PM via semantic queries for core flag invocation boolean arity, exact --defaults/--require-assertions takes_value symptoms, and direct tracker grep. Closed pm-11phn1 delivered semantic invocation metadata; closed pm-853a fixed extension-only arity; closed pm-m7bb7r fixed assurance --apply. None owns the current generic core-command derivation regression, so this is a new issue linked as discovered_from pm-11phn1 rather than reopening or duplicating those completed outcomes."
  "2026-08-18T19:18:09.404Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-18: active in one coupled SDK-first command-contract tranche spanning canonical flag concepts and budgets, truthful invocation arity, complete closed-domain recovery, refusal-closure scoring, source-derived executable recovery obligations, and shared CLI/MCP/completion/docs discovery metadata. This item is claimed because its acceptance surface will be edited and verified in this branch; unrelated parents and backlog items remain open and unclaimed."
  "2026-08-18T21:13:34.856Z","harness:codex","Completion evidence: command-scoped invocation contracts now derive boolean, required-value, optional-value, and repeatable arity from canonical declarations. The independent Commander parity gate observed 2,904 flags across 68 core commands with zero findings and its synthetic init --defaults mismatch failed as designed. Duplicate global/local --author rows are canonically merged. Packed npm SDK import plus npx and bunx acceptance passed; repository coverage passed 528 files / 7,581 tests at 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-18T21:37:26.207Z","harness:codex","Final local gate evidence after complexity hardening: pnpm lint passed ESLint, zero jscpd clones, static assurance, SDK import-cost budgets, CLI transport budgets, graph composition and record integrity; pnpm typecheck passed all project/type/package/example configs; security scan found no credential-like secrets; pnpm audit found no known vulnerabilities; final full suite passed 528 files and 7,581 tests at 100% (55,402 statements, 41,337 branches, 11,464 functions, 53,459 lines)."
  "2026-08-18T23:07:52.141Z","harness:codex","Review amendment evidence: exact-head review exposed prefix-based boolean inference for --only and undercounting duplicate executable observations. The contract now treats --only/--only-last as exact booleans, preserves future --only-* value flags, reports every matching observation including duplicates, and collapses dash/underscore rows before parity. Focused parity tests pass with 2,831 declared and observed canonical flags across 68 commands."
